  "details": "Right now stickers scale based on how far away you are when you place them. It would be a nice QOL improvement to have an option for static scale. Could even set it up so the  `/actions/Menu/in/Scroll` action bind changes the scale (desktop could scrollwheel too)\n\nI'm planning to place various avatar contacts on a sticker but if its scale is inconsistent, the contacts will be misaligned.",
